; Leg HM -- the 32 KB transfer half of the parser leg, driven from the
; C-Kermit> prompt on the Victor.  Host SENDS.
;
; WHY THIS EXISTS: edit 14 widened what main() compiles, so this binary is
; not the one measured at 1,170 cps.  rxlost=0 rxfull=0 and a byte-exact md5
; is what says the wire protocol did not move.  The parser build is 443K and
; a 640K-class build -- the first upstream merge ever to move a class -- and
; SS16ab is the last time a parser build ran on hardware, pre-merge.
;
; At the Victor's C-Kermit> prompt, before starting this:
;     set line /dev/seriala
;     set speed 38400
;     receive
; SET LINE must report LOCAL and SET SPEED must READ BACK (edit 15).

set speed 38400
set receive timeout 20
set parity none
set prefixing cautious
set block 3
set retry 30
log packets s16bcHM.pkt
send rcvhm.dat
statistics
